{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1516832-changeling-the-dreaming-c20-how-do-you-regain-glamor-within-dreaming","id":1516832,"title":"Changeling The Dreaming - C20 How do you regain glamor within Dreaming?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-30T16:18:33-07:00","id":1516832,"title":"Changeling The Dreaming - C20 How do you regain glamor within Dreaming?","content":"When the character goes into the Dreaming, how is he able to regain Glamour? Is there any rule for this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25762-yuesidhe","name":"YueSidhe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-08T13:46:14-07:00","id":1517517,"title":"","content":"The following ways come to mind:<br /> <br /> - Achieve your Kith's form of Revelry; a Satyr could throw a huge party for instance<br /> - In the Deep Dreaming you recover Glamour each turn<br /> - Achieve Rapture (self-inspiration)<br /> - Use the Infusion Art to transfer Glamour from one thing to another (a Changeling could get it from a willing Treasure, Chimera, Changeling etc.)<br /> - Muse or Ravage a mortal or Prodigal who is in the Dreaming<br /> - Sleep in one of the rare Freeholds which exists within the Dreaming proper, and have access to the Balefire<br /> - Destroy something created through Rhapsody<br /> - Sacrifice a permanent point of Glamour to refill your pool<br /> - Access situational Glamour points via a Contract or Oath<br /> <br /> Also worth noting that if you're in the Far Dreaming a Cantrip will be free to cast, so your need for Glamour will be more limited.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}